  "translation": "I got up at 7 in the morning. Then I eat breakfast, I often eat bread and eggs. I go to school from home, the school is in front of home and supermarket. At noon I eat together with classmates, we eat rice and vegetables. At 2 PM I have class, I can write Chinese characters, and I can also speak Chinese. After school I go home, after returning home I first do homework. In the evening I watch TV together with my mom at home, I drink a glass of water. My cat is under the chair, I don't have a younger sister. My book is on the table, I really like studying. I have a few good friends."
